# Environment variables for the ergonomic assessment application.
#
# Milestone 1 (sources and specifications) has no runtime, so no variable is required yet.
# Each later milestone adds the variables it needs here, with placeholder values only.
# Never put a real credential, token, or key in this file or in any committed file.
#
# Planned for milestone 3 (data and storage), pending the stack decision:
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://USER:PASSWORD@HOST:5432/DATABASE
# OBJECT_STORAGE_ENDPOINT=https://object-storage.example.invalid
# OBJECT_STORAGE_BUCKET=attachments-placeholder
# OBJECT_STORAGE_ACCESS_KEY_ID=placeholder
# OBJECT_STORAGE_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=placeholder
#
# Planned for milestone 3, pending the identity provider decision:
# AUTH_ISSUER_URL=https://identity-provider.example.invalid
# AUTH_CLIENT_ID=placeholder
# AUTH_CLIENT_SECRET=placeholder
